      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>OpaqueDeviceConfiguration contains configuration parameters for a driver in a format defined by the driver vendor.</p></dd>
