      <TableCell><code>parameters</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/rest_api/objects/index#io-k8s-apimachinery-pkg-runtime-RawExtension"><code>RawExtension</code></a></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Parameters can contain arbitrary data. It is the responsibility of the driver developer to handle validation and versioning. Typically this includes self-identification and a version ("kind" + "apiVersion" for Kubernetes types), with conversion between different versions.<Fragment set:html={"<br>"} />The length of the raw data must be smaller or equal to 10 Ki.</TableCell>
